WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:07.368
Every chart on this page draws its data from a single source: Health Canada's own annual reports on Medical Assistance in Dying.

00:00:07.318 --> 00:00:15.204
The bar charts, donut breakdowns, and daily death projections are not editorialised — they are the government's published numbers rendered in visual form.

00:00:15.204 --> 00:00:26.409
When forty-five Canadians are being killed per day by state-administered euthanasia and the growth trajectory shows no sign of flattening, a picture isn't worth a thousand words — it's worth seventy-six thousand lives.
